PHASE 4 — STREAK AND DAILY COMPLETION ENGINE

Implement a reliable streak system.

Rules

* A streak represents consecutive qualifying practice days.
* Completing one activity does not automatically mean the entire daily plan is complete.
* Define the daily completion requirement explicitly.
* The streak updates only after that requirement is satisfied.
* Multiple completed activities on the same day must count as one completed day.
* Retrying an activity must not create duplicate completion events.
* Handle local timezone and date boundaries correctly.
* Preserve the user’s historical streak data.

