FINAL PRODUCT ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

SpeakCraft should feel like a complete personalized communication-learning platform.

A returning user should be able to:

1. Open the application and receive a welcoming experience.
2. Swipe through personalized learning cards.
3. See a daily plan based on their goals and skill level.
4. Complete activities and see dashboard updates immediately.
5. Earn a streak only after satisfying daily completion requirements.
6. Receive learning notifications.
7. Manage their profile, settings and privacy.
8. Access the Admin Console only if authorized.
9. Learn a vocabulary word.
10. Speak the word and pass its assessment.
11. Speak practice sentences using the word.
12. Create and speak original sentences.
13. Receive evidence-based scores and feedback.
14. Complete and save the word.
15. Practice through quizzes and flashcards.
16. Maintain a personal vocabulary notebook.

The most important principle: build one connected learning ecosystem. Do not create disconnected screens with fake statistics, buttons that do nothing, or progress values that are not backed by actual completed learning activities.